.el .ds Aq '
.TH ngx-auth 1  "ngx-auth " 
.SH NAME
ngx\-auth \- Users of password\-protected sites (basic auth)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBngx\-auth\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Users of password\-protected sites (basic auth)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ngx\-auth\-list(1)
List the users who can log in
.TP
ngx\-auth\-add(1)
Add a user, or change their password (asked twice, or read from stdin with \-\-password\-stdin)
.TP
ngx\-auth\-rm(1)
Remove a user
.TP
ngx\-auth\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
